T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Geometric Principle of Diagonal Scales:) Tj
T*
(   The diagonal scale utilizes the theorem of similar right-angled triangles to subdivide an) Tj
T*
(   already small linear division into fractional increments without visual clutter.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Mathematical Derivation:) Tj
