(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the Function Keys \(F1 through F12\) in AutoCAD, explaining their assigned drafting toggles and practical workflow significance.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Complete Functional Mapping of F-Keys:) Tj
T*
(   - F1 \(Help System\): Opens the Autodesk Help browser for active commands.) Tj
T*
(   - F2 \(Expanded Text Window\): Toggles the expanded command line history window to review past) Tj
T*
(   command outputs.) Tj
