(   precision drafting.) Tj
T*
(   - F4 \(3D OSNAP\): Toggles 3D object snapping \(vertex, center of face, edge midpoint\) in 3D) Tj
T*
(   solids.) Tj
T*
(   - F5 \(Isoplane\): Cycles the active isometric drafting plane through Isoplane Top, Isoplane) Tj
T*
(   Left, and Isoplane Right when ISODRAFT mode is active.) Tj
T*
(   - F6 \(Dynamic UCS\): Toggles automatic alignment of the UCS XY plane with planar solid faces) Tj
T*
(   during 3D modeling.) Tj
T*
(   - F7 \(Grid Display\): Toggles the background drawing grid dots/lines ON and OFF.) Tj
T*
(   - F8 \(Ortho Mode\): Restricts cursor movement strictly to 0?, 90?, 180?, and 270? for drawing) Tj
T*
(   horizontal and vertical lines.) Tj
T*
(   - F9 \(Snap Mode\): Toggles cursor snapping to preset grid intervals.) Tj
T*
(   - F10 \(Polar Tracking\): Toggles polar angle tracking paths at user-specified angular increments) Tj
T*
(   \(e.g. 15?, 30?, 45?\).) Tj
T*
(   - F11 \(Object Snap Tracking - OTRACK\): Toggles tracking vectors aligned with acquired OSNAP) Tj
T*
(   points.) Tj
T*
(   - F12 \(Dynamic Input\): Toggles heads-up display of command prompts, length, and angle inputs) Tj
T*
(   directly near cursor crosshairs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
