12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Construct a diagonal scale with RF = 1:2.5 to show decimeters, centimeters, and millimeters, up to a maximum length of 4 decimeters. Show calculations and procedure to read 3.68 decimeters.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Mathematical Calculations:) Tj
T*
(   - Given: RF = 1 / 2.5 = 2 / 5.) Tj
T*
(   - Maximum Length \(ML\) = 4 decimeters = 40 cm = 400 mm.) Tj
T*
(   - Length of Scale \(LOS\) = RF x ML = \(1 / 2.5\) x 40 cm = 16.0 cm = 160 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Scale Division Architecture:) Tj
T*
(   - Divide the 160 mm length into 4 equal main divisions.) Tj
T*
(   Each main division = 160 mm / 4 = 40 mm, representing 1 decimeter \(1 dm\).) Tj
T*
(   - Place zero '0' at the 1st division mark from left. Mark 1, 2, 3 dm to the right.) Tj
T*
(   - Subdivide the leftmost 1-dm division \(40 mm wide\) into 10 equal parts.) Tj
T*
(   Each subdivision = 4 mm, representing 1 centimeter \(1 cm = 0.1 dm\).) Tj
T*
(   - Construct vertical scale rectangle of height 50 mm.) Tj
T*
(   Divide vertical height into 10 equal horizontal parts \(spaced 5 mm apart\), representing) Tj
T*
(   millimeters \(1 mm = 0.1 cm = 0.01 dm\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Diagonal Connections:) Tj
T*
(   - Connect bottom division 0 to top division 1; bottom 1 to top 2, and so forth, creating 10) Tj
T*
(   parallel diagonal lines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Measuring Target Distance 3.68 Decimeters \(3 dm + 6 cm + 8 mm\):) Tj
T*
(   - From zero mark, move 3 dm to the right along the baseline.) Tj
T*
(   - Move to the 6th centimeter mark to the left of zero.) Tj
T*
(   - Move vertically upward along the 6th diagonal line to the 8th horizontal line \(representing 8) Tj
T*
(   mm\).) Tj
T*
(   - The horizontal distance between the vertical line at 3 dm and the 6th diagonal at the 8th) Tj
T*
(   horizontal line is exactly 3.68 dm.) Tj
T*
(   - Draw extension lines and label: '3.68 dm'.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
