(   2. Key Configuration Tabs:) Tj
T*
(   - Lines Tab:) Tj
T*
(   * Dimension Lines: Color \(ByLayer\), Linetype, Lineweight \(0.25 mm\), Baseline spacing \(8-10 mm\).) Tj
T*
(   * Extension Lines: Extension beyond dimension line \(set to 2-3 mm\), Offset from origin \(set to) Tj
T*
(   1-1.5 mm\).) Tj
T*
(   - Symbols and Arrows Tab:) Tj
T*
(   * Arrowheads: Set First, Second, and Leader to 'Closed filled'.) Tj
T*
(   * Arrow size: 3.0 mm to 3.5 mm.) Tj
T*
(   * Center marks: Set to 'Mark' or 'Line' \(size 2.5 mm\).) Tj
T*
(   - Text Tab:) Tj
T*
(   * Text Style: Standard font \(ROMANS or ARIAL\).) Tj
T*
(   * Text Height: 3.5 mm for A3 sheets.) Tj
T*
(   * Text Placement: Vertical = 'Above' \(for Aligned system\) or 'Centered' \(for Unidirectional\).) Tj
T*
(   * Text Alignment: 'Aligned with dimension line' or 'Horizontal' \(ISO standard\).) Tj
T*
(   - Fit Tab:) Tj
T*
(   * Fit Options: 'Either text or arrows \(best fit\)' when space is tight between extension lines.) Tj
T*
(   * Use overall scale of: 1.0 \(for 1:1 drawing in model space\).) Tj
T*
(   - Primary Units Tab:) Tj
T*
(   * Unit format: Decimal | Precision: 0.00 | Decimal separator: Period \(.\).) Tj
T*
(   * Zero Suppression: Suppress trailing zeros \(e.g. 15.00 becomes 15\) or leading zeros as) Tj
T*
(   required.) Tj
