ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Summarize the essential best practices for maintaining drawing integrity, clean CAD layer structure, file management, and quality assurance in professional engineering drafting.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Standard Layer Management Hierarchy:) Tj
T*
(   - Organize every drawing strictly by functional layers with properties set to 'ByLayer' \(never) Tj
T*
(   assign colors or linetypes explicitly to individual objects\).) Tj
T*
(   - Standard Layer Setup:) Tj
T*
(   * Layer 0: System default \(reserved for block definitions\).) Tj
T*
(   * Defpoints: Non-printing layer created automatically by dimensions; do NOT place drawing) Tj
T*
(   geometry here.) Tj
T*
(   * VISIBLE: Color Blue/Black, Continuous, Lineweight 0.50 mm.) Tj
T*
(   * HIDDEN: Color Cyan, Linetype HIDDEN, Lineweight 0.25 mm.) Tj
T*
(   * CENTER: Color Red, Linetype CENTER, Lineweight 0.25 mm.) Tj
T*
(   * DIMENSIONS: Color Green, Continuous, Lineweight 0.25 mm.) Tj
T*
(   * HATCH: Color 8 \(Gray\), Continuous, Lineweight 0.18 mm.) Tj
T*
(   * TEXT_TITLE: Color Magenta, Continuous, Lineweight 0.35 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Precision Drafting Rules:) Tj
T*
(   - Always draft at 1:1 true scale in Model Space; apply scaling exclusively in Paper Space) Tj
T*
(   layout viewports.) Tj
T*
(   - Always use OSNAP \(F3\) and Ortho \(F8\) / Polar \(F10\); never eyeball line intersections or) Tj
T*
(   endpoints.) Tj
T*
(   - Run PURGE periodically to eliminate unused blocks, layers, and text styles.) Tj
T*
(   - Run AUDIT to detect and repair database errors.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Final Quality Assurance Checklist Prior to Plotting:) Tj
T*
(   - Verify sheet title block completeness \(Date, Name, Scale, Projection Angle symbol\).) Tj
T*
(   - Confirm all non-continuous lines display dashes properly \(check LTSCALE and run REGEN\).) Tj
T*
(   - Ensure dimension extension lines do not cross dimension lines or obscure vital part outlines.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
